Below you’ll find a **complete “starter kit”** – a minimal but fully‑functional Trucking Transportation Management System (TMS) written in modern JavaScript/TypeScript.  
It contains:

| Layer | What it does |
|-------|--------------|
| **API layer** (`src/api`) | REST endpoints powered by **Express + TypeScript** |
| **Domain / Service layer** (`src/services`) | Business logic & orchestration |
| **Data access layer** (`src/repositories`) | Database interaction through **Prisma ORM** |
| **External integrations** (`src/external`) | Weather lookup (Open‑Meteo), map routing, etc. |
| **Front‑end** (`frontend`) | Simple SPA built with **React + Vite** (optional) |
| **Testing** (`tests`) | Unit & integration tests with Jest |

> ⚠️ *This starter kit is intentionally lightweight so you can extend it as your needs grow.*  

---

