## 🎨 Extending the Starter Kit

Here are quick pointers on what to do next depending on your priorities:

| Feature | Where to start |
|---------|----------------|
| **Real‑time tracking** | Integrate WebSocket (e.g., Socket.io) in `routes/tracking.route.ts`; push GPS updates from trucks. |
| **Driver onboarding** | Build a separate microservice or module for HR management; expose `/drivers/register`, `/drivers/login`. |
| **Analytics dashboard** | Pull aggregated metrics from Prisma queries; feed them into Grafana dashboards. |
| **Map visualization** | Wrap Mapbox GL JS or Leaflet in `external/maps.api.ts`; render polyline routes on the front‑end. |
| **Payment gateway** | Add Stripe SDK calls in `payment.service.ts`; handle invoices per delivery. |
| **CI/CD pipeline** | GitHub Actions workflow that runs lint, build, tests, and deploys container image to AWS ECS/ECR. |

Feel free to drop me a line if you'd like deeper dives into any specific area—routing algorithms, fleet optimization, predictive maintenance analytics, etc. Happy coding!
